            "level": {
              "value": 2
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You have entered the ranks of the Mercenary League and now wear the black uniform that's the source of the organization's popular epithet. You become trained in Intimidation; if you were already trained, you become an expert instead. You gain the Additional Lore skill feat for Warfare Lore; if you were already trained in Warfare Lore, you also become trained in a Lore skill of your choice. While wearing medium or heavy armor, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Intimidation checks."
            }
